{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "分级采用文献或厂商参考，不是统一医学标准。骨量原表未分年龄，成人限制由本应用设定，不代表已验证所有成人年龄。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分级采用文献或厂商参考，不是统一医学标准。骨量原表未分年龄，成人限制由本应用设定，不代表已验证所有成人年龄。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分級採用文獻或廠商參考，並非統一醫學標準。骨量原表未按年齡區分，成人限制由本應用設定，不代表已驗證所有成人年齡。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Categories use published or manufacturer references, not a universal medical standard. The bone mass table is not age-specific; the adult restriction is set by this app and does not imply validation for every adult age."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Kategorien beruhen auf Literatur oder Herstellerangaben, nicht auf einem einheitlichen medizinischen Standard. Die Knochenmassetabelle unterscheidet nicht nach Alter. Die Beschränkung auf Erwachsene legt die App fest; sie bedeutet keine Validierung für jedes Erwachsenenalter."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las categorías usan referencias publicadas o del fabricante, no una norma médica universal. La tabla de masa ósea no distingue por edad; la app limita su uso a adultos sin implicar validación para todas las edades adultas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les catégories utilisent des références publiées ou du fabricant, et non une norme médicale universelle. Le tableau de masse osseuse ne distingue pas les âges ; la restriction aux adultes est définie par l’app et ne signifie pas une validation pour tous les âges adultes."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分類は文献やメーカーの参考値に基づき、統一された医学基準ではありません。骨量の元の表は年齢別ではなく、成人への制限は本アプリが設定したもので、すべての成人年齢で検証されたことを意味しません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"분류는 문헌 또는 제조사의 참고값을 사용하며 통일된 의학적 기준이 아닙니다. 골량 원표는 연령별로 구분되지 않으며 성인 제한은 앱이 설정한 것으로, 모든 성인 연령에서 검증되었다는 의미는 아닙니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As categorias usam referências publicadas ou do fabricante, não uma norma médica universal. A tabela de massa óssea não distingue idades; a restrição a adultos é definida pela app e não implica validação para todas as idades adultas."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Категории основаны на публикациях или данных производителя, а не на едином медицинском стандарте. Таблица костной массы не разделена по возрастам; ограничение для взрослых задано приложением и не означает проверку для всех взрослых возрастов."}}}},
    "优先展示设备经通信协议解析的数据，以及手动录入或导入的原始值；同一成分的质量与比例可按体重换算。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"优先展示设备经通信协议解析的数据，以及手动录入或导入的原始值；同一成分的质量与比例可按体重换算。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Device data decoded by its protocol and original manual or imported values take priority. Mass and percentage of the same component can be converted using weight."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protokollgemäß dekodierte Gerätedaten und manuelle oder importierte Originalwerte haben Vorrang. Masse und Anteil derselben Komponente lassen sich anhand des Gewichts umrechnen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tienen prioridad los datos del dispositivo interpretados por su protocolo y los valores originales manuales o importados. La masa y el porcentaje del mismo componente se convierten con el peso."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les données décodées selon le protocole de l’appareil et les valeurs originales saisies ou importées sont prioritaires. Masse et pourcentage d’un même composant se convertissent selon le poids."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通信プロトコルで解析した機器データと手入力・取り込みの元の値を優先します。同じ成分の質量と割合は体重で換算できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"통신 프로토콜로 해석한 기기 데이터와 수동 입력·가져온 원본 값을 우선합니다. 같은 성분의 질량과 비율은 체중으로 환산합니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os dados do dispositivo descodificados pelo protocolo e os valores originais manuais ou importados têm prioridade. Massa e percentagem do mesmo componente são convertidas usando o peso."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Приоритет имеют данные устройства, расшифрованные по протоколу, и исходные введённые или импортированные значения. Масса и доля одного компонента пересчитываются по весу."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"優先展示裝置經通訊協定解析的資料，以及手動輸入或匯入的原始值；同一成分的質量與比例可按體重換算。"}}}},
    "仍缺少的指标，仅在体脂秤提供有效主阻抗且满足年龄、资料条件时按应用规则补算。普通体重秤或无主阻抗时不补算身体成分；BMI 单独按体重和身高计算。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍缺少的指标，仅在体脂秤提供有效主阻抗且满足年龄、资料条件时按应用规则补算。普通体重秤或无主阻抗时不补算身体成分；BMI 单独按体重和身高计算。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Missing metrics are estimated only for body-composition scales with valid primary impedance and suitable age and profile inputs. Weight-only scales or records without primary impedance do not trigger composition estimates. BMI uses weight and height independently."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fehlende Werte werden nur bei Körperanalysewaagen mit gültiger Hauptimpedanz sowie passenden Alters- und Profildaten geschätzt. Reine Gewichtswaagen oder fehlende Hauptimpedanz lösen keine Schätzung aus. BMI wird unabhängig aus Gewicht und Größe berechnet."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los datos faltantes solo se estiman con una báscula de composición, impedancia principal válida y edad y perfil adecuados. Sin ello no se estima la composición. El BMI se calcula aparte con peso y altura."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les valeurs manquantes ne sont estimées qu’avec une balance de composition, une impédance principale valide et un âge et profil adaptés. Sans cela, aucune estimation de composition. Le BMI utilise séparément poids et taille."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不足項目は、有効な主インピーダンスを持つ体組成計の記録で、年齢・プロフィール条件を満たす場合のみ推定します。体重のみの体重計や主インピーダンスのない記録では推定しません。BMIは体重と身長から別途計算します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"누락 항목은 유효한 주 임피던스와 적합한 연령·프로필을 갖춘 체성분계 기록에서만 추정합니다. 일반 체중계나 주 임피던스가 없으면 체성분을 추정하지 않습니다. BMI는 체중과 키로 별도 계산합니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os valores em falta só são estimados para balanças de composição com impedância principal válida e idade e perfil adequados. Sem estas condições não há estimativa de composição. O BMI usa peso e altura separadamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Недостающие показатели оцениваются только для весов-анализаторов с допустимым основным импедансом, возрастом и профилем. Обычные весы и записи без основного импеданса не запускают оценку состава. BMI отдельно рассчитывается по весу и росту."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍缺少的指標，僅在體脂計提供有效主阻抗且滿足年齡、資料條件時按應用規則補算。普通體重計或無主阻抗時不補算身體成分；BMI 單獨按體重和身高計算。"}}}},
    "参考资料包含计算依据、指标定义或分级参考；不代表所有应用经验系数均得到文献验证。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"参考资料包含计算依据、指标定义或分级参考；不代表所有应用经验系数均得到文献验证。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"References cover calculations, definitions or rating ranges; they do not validate every app-specific heuristic coefficient."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quellen betreffen Berechnungen, Definitionen oder Einstufungen; sie validieren nicht jeden App-spezifischen Erfahrungskoeffizienten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las referencias cubren cálculos, definiciones o rangos; no validan todos los coeficientes empíricos de la app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les références couvrent calculs, définitions ou plages ; elles ne valident pas tous les coefficients empiriques de l’app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"参考資料は計算根拠・定義・分類を含み、すべてのアプリ経験係数が文献で検証済みという意味ではありません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"참고 자료는 계산 근거·정의·등급 범위를 다루며, 앱의 모든 경험 계수가 문헌으로 검증되었다는 뜻은 아닙니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As referências abrangem cálculos, definições ou intervalos; não validam todos os coeficientes empíricos da app."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Источники описывают расчёты, определения или категории; они не подтверждают каждый эмпирический коэффициент приложения."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"參考資料包含計算依據、指標定義或分級參考；不代表所有應用經驗係數均得到文獻驗證。"}}}},
    "未偏低" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未偏低"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not low"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nicht niedrig"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No bajo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non faible"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"低値ではない"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"낮지 않음"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Não baixo"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не понижен"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未偏低"}}}},
    "肌肉采用 Withings 的 20–79 岁年龄与性别参考范围；质量区间按体重换算。偏高不代表更健康。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"肌肉采用 Withings 的 20–79 岁年龄与性别参考范围；质量区间按体重换算。偏高不代表更健康。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Muscle uses Withings age- and sex-specific references for ages 20–79. Mass ranges scale with weight. Higher does not mean healthier."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Für Muskeln gelten die alters- und geschlechtsspezifischen Withings-Referenzen für 20–79 Jahre. Massebereiche hängen vom Gewicht ab. Höher bedeutet nicht gesünder."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El músculo usa referencias de Withings por edad y sexo para 20–79 años. Los rangos de masa dependen del peso. Más alto no significa más saludable."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les muscles suivent les références Withings selon l’âge et le sexe de 20 à 79 ans. Les plages de masse dépendent du poids. Plus élevé ne signifie pas plus sain."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"筋肉は20～79歳の年齢・性別別Withings参考範囲を使用します。質量範囲は体重に応じて換算します。高いほど健康とは限りません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"근육은 20–79세의 연령·성별 Withings 참고 범위를 사용합니다. 질량 범위는 체중에 따라 환산하며, 높을수록 건강한 것은 아닙니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O músculo usa referências Withings por idade e sexo dos 20 aos 79 anos. Os intervalos de massa dependem do peso. Mais alto não significa mais saudável."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для мышц используются нормы Withings по полу и возрасту 20–79 лет. Диапазоны массы зависят от веса. Более высокое значение не означает лучшее здоровье."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"肌肉採用 Withings 的 20–79 歲年齡與性別參考範圍；質量區間按體重換算。偏高不代表更健康。"}}}},
    "骨量参考 Withings：男性占体重 3%–5%，女性 2.5%–4%。本应用仅用于成人；不是骨密度分级。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量参考 Withings：男性占体重 3%–5%，女性 2.5%–4%。本应用仅用于成人；不是骨密度分级。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bone references from Withings: 3%–5% of weight for men, 2.5%–4% for women. This app restricts use to adults; these are not bone-density categories."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Withings-Knochenreferenzen: 3%–5% des Gewichts bei Männern, 2,5%–4% bei Frauen. Die App nutzt sie nur für Erwachsene; keine Knochendichtebewertung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referencia ósea de Withings: 3%–5% del peso en hombres y 2,5%–4% en mujeres. La app la limita a adultos; no clasifica la densidad ósea."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Référence osseuse Withings : 3–5 % du poids chez les hommes, 2,5–4 % chez les femmes. Usage limité aux adultes dans cette app ; ce n’est pas une classification de densité osseuse."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量はWithingsを参考に男性は体重の3～5%、女性は2.5～4%とします。本アプリでは成人のみが対象で、骨密度の分類ではありません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"골량은 Withings 기준으로 남성 체중의 3%–5%, 여성 2.5%–4%입니다. 앱에서는 성인에게만 적용하며 골밀도 등급이 아닙니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referência óssea Withings: 3%–5% do peso nos homens, 2,5%–4% nas mulheres. A app limita o uso a adultos; não classifica a densidade óssea."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ориентиры Withings для костной массы: 3–5% веса у мужчин, 2,5–4% у женщин. В приложении только для взрослых; это не оценка плотности костей."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量參考 Withings：男性占體重 3%–5%，女性 2.5%–4%。本應用僅用於成人；不是骨密度分級。"}}}},
    "去脂体重采用成人 FFMI 低值参考：男性 17、女性 15 kg/m²，乘以身高平方换算质量。未偏低不代表营养正常。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂体重采用成人 FFMI 低值参考：男性 17、女性 15 kg/m²，乘以身高平方换算质量。未偏低不代表营养正常。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fat-free mass uses adult low-FFMI references: 17 for men and 15 for women in kg/m², multiplied by height squared for mass. Not low does not mean normal nutrition."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fettfreie Masse nutzt niedrige FFMI-Grenzen für Erwachsene: 17 bei Männern, 15 bei Frauen in kg/m², multipliziert mit der Körpergröße zum Quadrat. Nicht niedrig bedeutet nicht normale Ernährung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La masa libre de grasa usa límites bajos de FFMI en adultos: 17 para hombres y 15 para mujeres en kg/m², multiplicados por la altura al cuadrado. No bajo no implica nutrición normal."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La masse maigre suit les seuils bas de FFMI adultes : 17 pour les hommes et 15 pour les femmes en kg/m², multipliés par la taille au carré. Non faible ne signifie pas un état nutritionnel normal."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"除脂肪体重は成人FFMIの低値基準（男性17、女性15 kg/m²）に身長の二乗を掛けて換算します。低値でなくても栄養状態が正常とは限りません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제지방량은 성인 FFMI 저수치 기준인 남성 17, 여성 15 kg/m²에 키의 제곱을 곱해 환산합니다. 낮지 않다는 것이 정상 영양 상태를 뜻하지는 않습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A massa sem gordura usa limiares baixos de FFMI em adultos: 17 nos homens e 15 nas mulheres em kg/m², multiplicados pela altura ao quadrado. Não baixo não implica nutrição normal."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для безжировой массы используются нижние пороги FFMI взрослых: 17 у мужчин и 15 у женщин в кг/м², умноженные на квадрат роста. Отсутствие низкого значения не означает нормальное питание."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂體重採用成人 FFMI 低值參考：男性 17、女性 15 kg/m²，乘以身高平方換算質量。未偏低不代表營養正常。"}}}},
    "肌肉与骨量参考 · Withings" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"肌肉与骨量参考 · Withings"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Muscle and bone references · Withings"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Muskel- und Knochenreferenzen · Withings"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referencias musculares y óseas · Withings"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Références musculaires et osseuses · Withings"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"筋肉・骨量の参考 · Withings"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"근육 및 골량 참고 · Withings"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referências musculares e ósseas · Withings"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мышцы и костная масса · Withings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"肌肉與骨量參考 · Withings"}}}},
    "去脂体重低值参考 · ESPEN" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂体重低值参考 · ESPEN"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Low fat-free mass reference · ESPEN"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niedrige fettfreie Masse · ESPEN"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referencia de masa libre de grasa baja · ESPEN"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Référence de masse maigre faible · ESPEN"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"除脂肪体重の低値参考 · ESPEN"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제지방량 저수치 참고 · ESPEN"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referência de massa sem gordura baixa · ESPEN"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Низкая безжировая масса · ESPEN"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂體重低值參考 · ESPEN"}}}},
    "内脏脂肪等级" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Viszeralfettstufe"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Visceral fat level"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nivel de grasa visceral"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niveau de graisse viscérale"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内臓脂肪レベル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내장 지방 수준"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nível de gordura visceral"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Уровень висцерального жира"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内脏脂肪等级"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內臟脂肪等級"}}}},
    "体水分率" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Körperwasseranteil"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Body water percentage"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Porcentaje de agua corporal"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Taux d’eau corporelle"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"体水分率"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"체수분 비율"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Percentagem de água corporal"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Процент воды в организме"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"体水分率"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"體水分率"}}}},
    "儿童阻抗研究 · Schaefer" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impedanzstudie bei Kindern · Schaefer"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Child impedance study · Schaefer"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impedancia infantil · Schaefer"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impédance pédiatrique · Schaefer"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小児インピーダンス研究 · Schaefer"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아동 임피던스 연구 · Schaefer"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impedância infantil · Schaefer"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Детский импеданс · Schaefer"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"儿童阻抗研究 · Schaefer"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"兒童阻抗研究 · Schaefer"}}}},
