    "配置将替换本机配置，并把文件中的 %lld 条记录与本机记录合并。重复记录不会重复保存。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Konfiguration ersetzt die lokale Konfiguration. %lld Datensätze aus der Datei werden mit den lokalen Datensätzen zusammengeführt. Duplikate werden nicht erneut gespeichert."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The configuration will replace the local configuration, and %lld records from the file will be merged with local records. Duplicates will not be saved again."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La configuración sustituirá la configuración local y se combinarán %lld registros del archivo con los registros locales. Los duplicados no se guardarán de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La configuration remplacera la configuration locale et %lld mesures du fichier seront fusionnées avec les mesures locales. Les doublons ne seront pas enregistrés à nouveau."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定は端末の設定を置き換え、ファイル内の%lld件の記録を端末の記録と結合します。重複する記録は保存されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정은 기기의 설정을 대체하고 파일의 기록 %lld개를 기기의 기록과 병합합니다. 중복 기록은 다시 저장되지 않습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A configuração substituirá a configuração local e serão combinados %lld registos do ficheiro com os registos locais. Os duplicados não serão guardados novamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Конфигурация заменит локальную, а %lld записей из файла будут объединены с локальными записями. Дубликаты не будут сохранены повторно."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置将替换本机配置，并把文件中的 %lld 条记录与本机记录合并。重复记录不会重复保存。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定將取代本機設定，並把檔案中的 %lld 筆記錄與本機記錄合併。重複記錄不會重複儲存。"}}}},
    "配置文件" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konfigurationsdatei"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configuration File"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivo de configuración"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fichier de configuration"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定ファイル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정 파일"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ficheiro de configuração"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Файл конфигурации"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置文件"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定檔案"}}}},
    "长辈" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ältere Person"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Older adult"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persona mayor"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Senior"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シニア"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"어르신"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pessoa idosa"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пожилой человек"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"长辈"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"長輩"}}}},
    "隐私政策" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Datenschutzrichtlinie"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Privacy Policy"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Política de privacidad"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Politique de confidentialité"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"プライバシーポリシー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"개인정보 처리방침"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Política de privacidade"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Политика конфиденциальности"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隐私政策"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隱私權政策"}}}},
    "青少年" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jugendlicher"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Teenager"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adolescente"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adolescent"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青少年"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"청소년"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adolescente"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подросток"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青少年"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青少年"}}}},
    "青少年女儿" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tochter im Teenageralter"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Teenage daughter"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hija adolescente"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fille adolescente"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"10代の娘"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"십 대 딸"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filha adolescente"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дочь-подросток"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青少年女儿"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青少年女兒"}}}},
    "数据说明" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dateninformationen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Data Information"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Información de los datos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Informations sur les données"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"データについて"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"데이터 안내"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Informações dos dados"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сведения о данных"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据说明"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"資料說明"}}}},
    "数据来源" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Datenquellen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Data Sources"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fuentes de datos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sources des données"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"データの出所"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"데이터 출처"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fontes de dados"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Источники данных"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据来源"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"資料來源"}}}},
    "测量记录可能来自已连接的蓝牙体重秤、手动录入，或在授权后从 Apple 健康导入；模拟模式只使用示例数据。手机本身不能测量体重或身体成分。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Messungen können von einer verbundenen Bluetooth-Waage, aus manueller Eingabe oder nach Freigabe aus Apple Health stammen. Der Simulationsmodus verwendet nur Beispieldaten. Das Telefon selbst misst weder Gewicht noch Körperzusammensetzung."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Records may come from a connected Bluetooth scale, manual entry, or Apple Health after authorization. Simulation mode uses sample data only. The phone itself cannot measure weight or body composition."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los registros pueden proceder de una báscula Bluetooth conectada, de entradas manuales o de Apple Salud tras la autorización. El modo de simulación solo usa datos de ejemplo. El teléfono no mide el peso ni la composición corporal por sí solo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les mesures peuvent provenir d’une balance Bluetooth connectée, d’une saisie manuelle ou d’Apple Santé après autorisation. Le mode simulation utilise uniquement des exemples. Le téléphone seul ne mesure ni le poids ni la composition corporelle."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"測定記録は、接続したBluetooth体重計、手入力、または許可後のAppleヘルスケアから取得される場合があります。シミュレーションモードはサンプルデータのみを使用します。スマートフォン単体では体重や体組成を測定できません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"측정 기록은 연결된 Bluetooth 체중계, 직접 입력 또는 권한 허용 후 Apple 건강에서 가져올 수 있습니다. 시뮬레이션 모드는 예시 데이터만 사용합니다. 휴대전화 자체로는 체중이나 체성분을 측정할 수 없습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os registos podem vir de uma balança Bluetooth ligada, da introdução manual ou da Apple Saúde após autorização. O modo de simulação usa apenas dados de exemplo. O telemóvel não mede o peso nem a composição corporal por si só."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Записи могут поступать с подключённых Bluetooth-весов, вводиться вручную или импортироваться из Apple Здоровье после разрешения. Режим симуляции использует только примеры. Сам телефон не измеряет вес или состав тела."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"测量记录可能来自已连接的蓝牙体重秤、手动录入，或在授权后从 Apple 健康导入；模拟模式只使用示例数据。手机本身不能测量体重或身体成分。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"測量記錄可能來自已連接的藍牙體重計、手動輸入，或在授權後從 Apple 健康匯入；模擬模式只使用範例資料。手機本身不能測量體重或身體組成。"}}}},
    "计算方法" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Berechnungsmethoden"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Calculation Methods"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Métodos de cálculo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Méthodes de calcul"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"計算方法"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"계산 방법"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Métodos de cálculo"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Методы расчёта"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"计算方法"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"計算方法"}}}},
    "BMI 公式 · CDC" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMI-Formel · CDC"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMI Formula · CDC"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fórmula del IMC · CDC"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formule de l’IMC · CDC"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMIの計算式 · CDC"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMI 계산식 · CDC"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fórmula do IMC · CDC"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Формула ИМТ · CDC"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMI 公式 · CDC"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"BMI 公式 · CDC"}}}},
    "生物电阻抗 · NCBI" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bioimpedanz · NCBI"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bioelectrical Impedance · NCBI"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impedancia bioeléctrica · NCBI"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impédance bioélectrique · NCBI"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生体電気インピーダンス · NCBI"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"생체전기 임피던스 · NCBI"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impedância bioelétrica · NCBI"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Биоимпеданс · NCBI"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生物电阻抗 · NCBI"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生物電阻抗 · NCBI"}}}},
    "水分影响 · PubMed" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einfluss der Hydration · PubMed"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hydration Effects · PubMed"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Efectos de la hidratación · PubMed"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Effets de l’hydratation · PubMed"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"水分状態の影響 · PubMed"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"수분 상태의 영향 · PubMed"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Efeitos da hidratação · PubMed"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Влияние гидратации · PubMed"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"水分影响 · PubMed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"水分影響 · PubMed"}}}},
    "查看数据来源、计算方法、使用边界和参考依据。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Datenquellen, Berechnungsmethoden, Nutzungsgrenzen und Referenzen anzeigen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View data sources, calculation methods, usage limitations, and references."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consulta las fuentes de datos, los métodos de cálculo, las limitaciones de uso y las referencias."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consultez les sources de données, les méthodes de calcul, les limites d’utilisation et les références."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"データの出所、計算方法、利用上の限界、参考資料を確認します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"데이터 출처, 계산 방법, 사용 한계 및 참고 자료를 확인합니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Consulte as fontes de dados, os métodos de cálculo, as limitações de utilização e as referências."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сведения об источниках данных, методах расчёта, ограничениях использования и справочных материалах."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看数据来源、计算方法、使用边界和参考依据。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看資料來源、計算方法、使用限制和參考依據。"}}}},
    "首页" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Home"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inicio"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Accueil"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ホーム"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"홈"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Início"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Главная"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"首页"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"首頁"}}}},
    "骨量" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Knochenmasse"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bone mass"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masa ósea"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masse osseuse"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"골량"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Massa óssea"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Костная масса"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量"}}}},
    "骨量占比" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Knochenanteil"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bone %"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Porcentaje óseo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Taux osseux"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量率"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"골량 비율"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Percentagem óssea"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Процент костной массы"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量占比"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"骨量比例"}}}},
    "身体成分仅供趋势参考，不用于诊断或治疗。在作出医疗决定前，请咨询医生。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身体成分仅供趋势参考，不用于诊断或治疗。在作出医疗决定前，请咨询医生。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身體組成僅供趨勢參考，不用於診斷或治療。在作出醫療決定前，請諮詢醫生。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Body composition is for tracking trends, not diagnosis or treatment. Consult a doctor before making medical decisions."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Körperzusammensetzung dient der Trendbeobachtung, nicht der Diagnose oder Behandlung. Holen Sie vor medizinischen Entscheidungen ärztlichen Rat ein."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La composición corporal sirve para observar tendencias, no para diagnosticar ni tratar. Consulte a un médico antes de tomar decisiones médicas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La composition corporelle sert à suivre les tendances, pas à diagnostiquer ni à traiter. Consultez un médecin avant toute décision médicale."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"体組成は傾向を把握するための参考情報であり、診断や治療には使用できません。医療上の判断をする前に医師に相談してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"체성분은 추세 참고용이며 진단이나 치료에 사용하지 않습니다. 의학적 결정을 내리기 전에 의사와 상담하세요."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A composição corporal serve para acompanhar tendências, não para diagnóstico ou tratamento. Consulte um médico antes de tomar decisões médicas."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Состав тела служит для наблюдения за тенденциями, а не для диагностики или лечения. Перед медицинскими решениями проконсультируйтесь с врачом."}}}},
    "小组件会在本机与主应用共享成员名称、设备名称和趋势记录的加密副本，用于显示趋势。移除小组件不会删除主应用中的记录；删除记录后，小组件会在系统刷新时更新。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小组件会在本机与主应用共享成员名称、设备名称和趋势记录的加密副本，用于显示趋势。移除小组件不会删除主应用中的记录；删除记录后，小组件会在系统刷新时更新。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小工具會在本機與主程式共享成員名稱、裝置名稱及趨勢記錄的加密副本，用於顯示趨勢。移除小工具不會刪除主程式中的記錄；刪除記錄後，小工具會在系統重新整理時更新。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Widgets share an encrypted on-device copy of member names, device names and trend records with the app to display trends. Removing a widget does not delete app records. After records are deleted, widgets update when the system refreshes them."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Widgets teilen eine verschlüsselte lokale Kopie von Mitgliedsnamen, Gerätenamen und Trenddaten mit der App. Das Entfernen eines Widgets löscht keine App-Daten. Nach dem Löschen von Einträgen werden Widgets bei der nächsten Systemaktualisierung aktualisiert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los widgets comparten con la app una copia cifrada en el dispositivo de los nombres de miembros, dispositivos y registros de tendencias. Eliminar un widget no borra los registros de la app. Tras borrar registros, los widgets se actualizan cuando el sistema los refresca."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les widgets partagent avec l’app une copie chiffrée sur l’appareil des noms de membres, des appareils et des données de tendance. Retirer un widget ne supprime pas les données de l’app. Après suppression de données, les widgets sont actualisés lors du rafraîchissement par le système."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ウィジェットは、メンバー名、デバイス名、傾向の記録の暗号化されたコピーを端末内でアプリと共有し、傾向を表示します。ウィジェットを削除してもアプリの記録は削除されません。記録の削除後は、システムによる更新時に反映されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"위젯은 추세를 표시하기 위해 회원 이름, 기기 이름, 추세 기록의 암호화된 사본을 기기 내에서 앱과 공유합니다. 위젯을 제거해도 앱 기록은 삭제되지 않습니다. 기록 삭제 후 시스템이 위젯을 새로 고칠 때 반영됩니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os widgets partilham com a app uma cópia encriptada no dispositivo dos nomes dos membros, dispositivos e registos de tendências. Remover um widget não elimina os registos da app. Após eliminar registos, os widgets são atualizados quando o sistema os atualizar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Виджеты используют общую с приложением зашифрованную копию имён участников, названий устройств и записей тенденций на устройстве. Удаление виджета не удаляет записи приложения. После удаления записей виджеты обновляются при обновлении системой."}}}},
    "更新日期：2026年10月12日" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新日期：2026年10月12日"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新日期：2026年10月12日"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Updated: October 12, 2026"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktualisiert: 12. Oktober 2026"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actualizado: 12 de octubre de 2026"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mise à jour : 12 octobre 2026"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新日：2026年10月12日"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"업데이트: 2026년 10월 12일"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Atualizado: 12 de outubro de 2026"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Обновлено: 12 октября 2026 г."}}}},
    "去脂体重" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂体重"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fat-free mass"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fettfreie Masse"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masa libre de grasa"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masse maigre"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"除脂肪量"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제지방량"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Massa livre de gordura"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Безжировая масса"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"去脂體重"}}}},
    "静息能量消耗" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"静息能量消耗"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Resting energy expenditure"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ruheenergieverbrauch"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gasto energético en reposo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dépense énergétique au repos"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安静時エネルギー消費量"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"안정 시 에너지 소비량"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gasto energético em repouso"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Расход энергии в покое"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"靜息能量消耗"}}}},
    "测量保存时计算并保存指标，导出 JSON 包含计算结果。修改成员资料不会自动重算历史结果；估算不作为设备体脂率同步到 Apple 健康。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"测量保存时计算并保存指标，导出 JSON 包含计算结果。修改成员资料不会自动重算历史结果；估算不作为设备体脂率同步到 Apple 健康。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"儲存測量時會計算並儲存指標，匯出 JSON 包含計算結果。修改成員資料不會自動重算歷史結果；估算不會作為裝置體脂率同步至 Apple 健康。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Metrics are calculated and saved with each measurement and included in JSON exports. Profile edits do not automatically recalculate past results. Estimates are not synced to Apple Health as device body fat readings."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kennzahlen werden mit jeder Messung berechnet, gespeichert und in JSON exportiert. Profiländerungen berechnen frühere Ergebnisse nicht automatisch neu. Schätzungen werden nicht als Geräte-Körperfettwerte an Apple Health übertragen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los indicadores se calculan y guardan con cada medición y se incluyen en el JSON exportado. Editar el perfil no recalcula automáticamente los resultados anteriores. Las estimaciones no se sincronizan con Salud de Apple como lecturas de grasa corporal del dispositivo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les indicateurs sont calculés et enregistrés avec chaque mesure et inclus dans les exports JSON. Modifier le profil ne recalcule pas automatiquement les résultats passés. Les estimations ne sont pas synchronisées avec Santé comme mesures de graisse corporelle de l’appareil."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"測定の保存時に指標を計算して保存し、JSONの書き出しにも含めます。プロフィールを変更しても過去の結果は自動で再計算されません。推定値は機器の体脂肪率としてAppleヘルスケアに同期されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"측정 저장 시 지표를 계산하고 저장하며 JSON 내보내기에도 포함합니다. 프로필을 수정해도 과거 결과는 자동으로 다시 계산되지 않습니다. 추정치는 기기의 체지방률로 Apple 건강에 동기화되지 않습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os indicadores são calculados e guardados com cada medição e incluídos nas exportações JSON. Alterar o perfil não recalcula automaticamente os resultados anteriores. As estimativas não são sincronizadas com a Saúde da Apple como leituras de gordura corporal do dispositivo."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Показатели рассчитываются и сохраняются вместе с измерением и включаются в экспорт JSON. Изменение профиля не пересчитывает прошлые результаты автоматически. Оценки не передаются в Apple Здоровье как показания жира устройства."}}}},
    "成人静息能量研究 · PubMed" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成人静息能量研究 · PubMed"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adult resting-energy study · PubMed"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Studie zur Ruheenergie bei Erwachsenen · PubMed"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estudio de energía en reposo en adultos · PubMed"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Étude de l’énergie au repos chez l’adulte · PubMed"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成人の安静時エネルギー研究 · PubMed"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"성인 안정 시 에너지 연구 · PubMed"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estudo de energia em repouso em adultos · PubMed"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Исследование энергии покоя у взрослых · PubMed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成人靜息能量研究 · PubMed"}}}},
